    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis mid-terrace townhouse offers excellent potential, a blank canvas for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors. Situated in a highly convenient town centre location, the property requires some internal modernization and upgrading but boasts a solid structure and an excellent layout.Comprising open plan living space, two bedrooms and bathrooms. It is within walking distance of local schools, recreational amenities and public transport terminals. It has oil fired central heating and double glazing throughout.To place an offer on this property, register for your mySherryFitz account at SherryFitz.ie."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nKitchen/Dining/Living Room - 6.36m x 4.66m\nFitted floor and wall units. Tiled splashback. Wooden floor. Solid fuel stove. Blinds. Light fittings. Door to yard.\n\nLanding - 3.92m x 0.74m\nWooden floor. Attic access.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.03m x 3.01m\nWooden floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.27m x 4.78m\nLino flooring. Curtain pole.\n\nBathroom - 2.27m x 2.98m\nLino flooring. Toilet. Sink. Bath. Part tiled walls. Electric shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
